# NOTICE

## Upstream

`lib/index.js` and `lib/client.js` are derived from
**@zerorigin-studio/dsh-deepseek-chat v0.3.4**

- Author: caoganghui
- License: MIT
- Repository: https://github.com/zerorigin-studio/dsh-deepseek-chat

The upstream files are compiled bundles (the upstream project does not publish
TypeScript sources yet), so this fork carries them as-is with a documented set
of textual modifications, listed in `CHANGELOG.md` and in the "Relationship to
upstream" section of `README.md`:

- the settings namespace is renamed to `dsh-inapp-chat`;
- the click handler no longer falls back to the system browser inside a desktop
  shell — it shows an in-app dialog;
- a legacy `window.chrome.webview` bridge adapter is kept from upstream and the
  bridge detection is factored into `desktopBridge()` / `insideDesktopShell()`.

