## Third-party

`tools/asar_tool.cjs` is an original, dependency-free implementation of the
asar container format (read / rebuild / verify). It writes archives in the
Electron Pickle layout used by `@electron/asar`; it contains no third-party
code.

`lib/index.js` additionally vendors a copy of `schemastery` (MIT) exactly as
shipped by the upstream package, because the DSH settings registry expects a
`schemastery` schema object.
